      "question": "Mr. Sorva handles all purchase orders ---- unless special approvals are needed.",
      "choices": [
        "he",
        "him",
        "his",
        "himself"
      ],
      "answer": "D",
      "difficulty": "easy",
      "topic": "反身代词",
      "keywords": "reflexive pronoun himself",
      "answer_explain": "句子的主语、谓语和宾语已完整，空格处用 himself 强调 Sorva 先生本人亲自处理。he 是主格，him 是宾格，his 是物主代词，均不能在这里作这种强调成分。unless 表示除非。",
